{"seq":2,"slug":"event-driven-architecture","title":"事件驱动架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-design/architecture-patterns/event-driven-architecture","wordCount":950,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"事件驱动架构\">事件驱动架构</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>事件驱动架构（EDA）颠覆了请求-响应的同步调用模式：服务通过<strong>发布事件</strong>通知状态变化，其他服务通过<strong>订阅事件</strong>做出响应，从而实现松耦合的异步协作。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>核心优势</strong>：松耦合、可扩展（新增消费者无需改生产者）、弹性（消费者故障不影响生产者）、可审计（事件流即操作日志）、异步处理。</li>\n<li><strong>事件三分类</strong>：通知事件（告知&quot;发生了什么&quot;，如 OrderCreated）、状态转移事件（携带变更前后快照）、命令事件（请求某服务执行操作）。</li>\n<li><strong>事件溯源（Event Sourcing）</strong>：存储导致状态变化的所有事件而非当前状态，当前状态由回放事件计算；优势是完整审计与时间旅行调试，挑战是事件增长与 Schema 演进。</li>\n<li><strong>CQRS</strong>：读写使用不同模型与存储，各自优化；典型场景是读写比极度不平衡（如 1000:1）或读写模型差异大。</li>\n<li><strong>Saga 模式</strong>：用一系列本地事务 + 补偿操作替代跨服务 ACID 事务，实现最终一致性。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"从请求驱动到事件驱动\">从请求驱动到事件驱动</h2><p>传统的请求-响应架构中，服务之间通过同步调用协作——服务 A 直接调用服务 B，等待响应后继续处理。事件驱动架构（Event-Driven Architecture, EDA）颠覆了这种模式：服务通过<strong>发布事件</strong>来通知状态变化，其他服务通过<strong>订阅事件</strong>来做出响应。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;请求驱动&quot;&#10;        A1[订单服务] --&gt;|调用| B1[库存服务]&#10;        A1 --&gt;|调用| C1[支付服务]&#10;        A1 --&gt;|调用| D1[通知服务]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;事件驱动&quot;&#10;        A2[订单服务] --&gt;|发布: OrderCreated| Bus[事件总线]&#10;        Bus --&gt;|订阅| B2[库存服务]&#10;        Bus --&gt;|订阅| C2[支付服务]&#10;        Bus --&gt;|订阅| D2[通知服务]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph \"请求驱动\"\n        A1[订单服务] --&gt;|调用| B1[库存服务]\n        A1 --&gt;|调用| C1[支付服务]\n        A1 --&gt;|调用| D1[通知服务]\n    end\n    subgraph \"事件驱动\"\n        A2[订单服务] --&gt;|发布: OrderCreated| Bus[事件总线]\n        Bus --&gt;|订阅| B2[库存服务]\n        Bus --&gt;|订阅| C2[支付服务]\n        Bus --&gt;|订阅| D2[通知服务]\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"核心优势\">核心优势</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>松耦合</td>\n<td>生产者不需要知道消费者的存在</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可扩展性</td>\n<td>新增消费者只需订阅事件，无需修改生产者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>弹性</td>\n<td>消费者故障不影响生产者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可审计</td>\n<td>事件流本身就是完整的操作日志</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异步处理</td>\n<td>生产者无需等待消费结果</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"事件的分类\">事件的分类</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface DomainEvent {&#10;  eventId: string;&#10;  eventType: string;&#10;  aggregateId: string;&#10;  timestamp: number;&#10;  version: number;&#10;  payload: unknown;&#10;}&#10;&#10;type NotificationEvent = DomainEvent &amp; {&#10;  eventType: &#39;OrderCreated&#39; | &#39;UserRegistered&#39; | &#39;PaymentCompleted&#39;;&#10;};&#10;&#10;type StateTransferEvent = DomainEvent &amp; {&#10;  eventType: &#39;UserProfileUpdated&#39;;&#10;  payload: {&#10;    before: Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;;&#10;    after: Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;;&#10;  };&#10;};&#10;&#10;type CommandEvent = DomainEvent &amp; {&#10;  eventType: &#39;ProcessPayment&#39; | &#39;SendNotification&#39;;&#10;  payload: {&#10;    targetService: string;&#10;    command: Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;;&#10;  };&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DomainEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  eventId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  eventType</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  aggregateId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  payload</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NotificationEvent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DomainEvent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  eventType</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'OrderCreated'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'UserRegistered'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'PaymentCompleted'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> StateTransferEvent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DomainEvent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  eventType</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'UserProfileUpdated'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  payload</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    before</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    after</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CommandEvent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DomainEvent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  eventType</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ProcessPayment'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'SendNotification'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  payload</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    targetService</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    command</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>通知事件</td>\n<td>告知&quot;发生了什么&quot;</td>\n<td>OrderCreated、UserRegistered</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态转移事件</td>\n<td>携带完整的状态变化</td>\n<td>包含变更前后的数据快照</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>命令事件</td>\n<td>请求某个服务执行操作</td>\n<td>ProcessPayment、SendEmail</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"事件溯源-event-sourcing\">事件溯源（Event Sourcing）</h2><p>传统方式存储的是数据的<strong>当前状态</strong>，而事件溯源存储的是导致状态变化的<strong>所有事件</strong>。当前状态通过回放事件来计算。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant U as 用户&#10;    participant S as 系统&#10;    participant ES as 事件存储&#10;&#10;    U-&gt;&gt;S: 创建购物车&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;ES: CartCreated { cartId: &quot;c1&quot; }&#10;&#10;    U-&gt;&gt;S: 添加商品 A&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;ES: ItemAdded { cartId: &quot;c1&quot;, item: &quot;A&quot;, qty: 1 }&#10;&#10;    U-&gt;&gt;S: 添加商品 B&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;ES: ItemAdded { cartId: &quot;c1&quot;, item: &quot;B&quot;, qty: 2 }&#10;&#10;    U-&gt;&gt;S: 移除商品 A&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;ES: ItemRemoved { cartId: &quot;c1&quot;, item: &quot;A&quot; }&#10;&#10;    Note over ES: 事件存储中保存了完整的操作历史&#10;    Note over S: 当前状态 = 回放所有事件&lt;br/&gt;Cart: { B: 2 }\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant U as 用户\n    participant S as 系统\n    participant ES as 事件存储\n\n    U-&gt;&gt;S: 创建购物车\n    S-&gt;&gt;ES: CartCreated { cartId: \"c1\" }\n\n    U-&gt;&gt;S: 添加商品 A\n    S-&gt;&gt;ES: ItemAdded { cartId: \"c1\", item: \"A\", qty: 1 }\n\n    U-&gt;&gt;S: 添加商品 B\n    S-&gt;&gt;ES: ItemAdded { cartId: \"c1\", item: \"B\", qty: 2 }\n\n    U-&gt;&gt;S: 移除商品 A\n    S-&gt;&gt;ES: ItemRemoved { cartId: \"c1\", item: \"A\" }\n\n    Note over ES: 事件存储中保存了完整的操作历史\n    Note over S: 当前状态 = 回放所有事件&lt;br/&gt;Cart: { B: 2 }</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface CartEvent {&#10;  eventId: string;&#10;  cartId: string;&#10;  type: &#39;CartCreated&#39; | &#39;ItemAdded&#39; | &#39;ItemRemoved&#39; | &#39;CartCheckedOut&#39;;&#10;  data: Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;;&#10;  timestamp: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface CartState {&#10;  id: string;&#10;  items: Map&lt;string, number&gt;;&#10;  status: &#39;active&#39; | &#39;checked_out&#39;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function rebuildCart(events: CartEvent[]): CartState {&#10;  const state: CartState = {&#10;    id: &#39;&#39;,&#10;    items: new Map(),&#10;    status: &#39;active&#39;,&#10;  };&#10;&#10;  for (const event of events) {&#10;    switch (event.type) {&#10;      case &#39;CartCreated&#39;:&#10;        state.id = event.cartId;&#10;        break;&#10;      case &#39;ItemAdded&#39;:&#10;        const addItem = event.data as { productId: string; quantity: number };&#10;        const existing = state.items.get(addItem.productId) ?? 0;&#10;        state.items.set(addItem.productId, existing + addItem.quantity);&#10;        break;&#10;      case &#39;ItemRemoved&#39;:&#10;        const removeItem = event.data as { productId: string };&#10;        state.items.delete(removeItem.productId);&#10;        break;&#10;      case &#39;CartCheckedOut&#39;:&#10;        state.status = &#39;checked_out&#39;;&#10;        break;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return state;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CartEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  eventId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  cartId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'CartCreated'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ItemAdded'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ItemRemoved'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'CartCheckedOut'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#